{"sec": "map:649", "key": "The crystals glitter with fissures...", "en": "The crystals glitter with fissures...", "ja": "結晶は　ひび割れながら　きらめいている……"}
{"sec": "map:649", "key": "The crystals shattered!", "en": "The crystals shattered!", "ja": "結晶が　砕け散った!"}
{"sec": "map:649", "key": "The Key reacted to the Crystal!", "en": "The Key reacted to the Crystal!", "ja": "カギが　クリスタルに　反応した!"}
{"sec": "map:649", "key": "TAKA: Oh. That's convenient.", "en": "TAKA: Oh. That's convenient.", "ja": "タカ: おっと。それは　都合が　いいですね。"}
{"sec": "map:649", "key": "No swimming necessary.", "en": "No swimming necessary.", "ja": "泳ぐ必要　なしですか。"}
{"sec": "map:649", "key": "Or punching, for that matter.", "en": "Or punching, for that matter.", "ja": "というか　殴る必要も　なしですね。"}
